*\n\n### Type Literal\n\n```ts\n{\n  data: string;\n  filename?: string;\n  mimeType: string;\n}\n```\n\n#### data\n\n```ts\ndata: string;\n```\n\nBase64-encoded file bytes.\n\n#### filename?\n\n```ts\noptional filename?: string;\n```\n\nOptional filename hint sent to providers that accept one.\n\n#### mimeType\n\n```ts\nmimeType: string;\n```\n\nMIME type of the bytes (e.g. `'image/png'`, `'application/pdf'`).\n"}
